Here is what I did:

Use:

```
@Path("/greeting")
public class GreetingResource {

    @Inject
    @ConfigProperty(name = "testProp")
    private String testProp;

    @GET
    @Produces(MediaType.TEXT_PLAIN)
    public String hello() {
        return testProp;
    }
}
```
and 

```
testProp = asdf
```

Execute:

```
mvn clean compile
mvn quarkus:dev
```

Hitting `http://localhost:8080/greeting` correctly returns: `asdf`

Now add `testProp2 = hello` to `microprofile-config.properties`.

change `@ConfigProperty(name = "testProp")` to `@ConfigProperty(name = "testProp2")`.
After doing that when I hit `http://localhost:8080/greeting` again I get:

```
Caused by: java.lang.IllegalStateException: No config value exists for: testProp2
```
